  'migration merged; portfolio-execute completes the six projects on its next run; the issue-2930 probe answers on the next remediation tick',
  'six issue_project_map rows, one contract probe, twenty issue description appends; all reversible from the Rollback header and cluster_e_probe_backup',
  'the Rollback header',
  'no-mapped-work umbrella and the re-probe issue close by their own probes; each other issue states its measured blocker',
